            "It can't be removed",
            "It must be freed twice",
            "Nothing"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "That's why removev returns the (maybe new) head."
        },
        {
          "id": "c17-l3-e3",
          "type": "order_lines",
          "prompt": "Insert the node n after p.",
          "lines": [
